      <p style="text-indent: 1em" rend="first-line-indent(1)"><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-41566-41587"><rb>渠等</rb><rt>かれら</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-41587-41590">は</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-41590-41605"><rb>敢</rb><rt>あへ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-41605-41608">て</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-41608-41623"><rb>鬼</rb><rt>おに</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-41623-41638">ではない、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-41638-41653"><rb>食</rb><rt>じき</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-41653-41656">を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-41656-41668"><rb>得</rb><rt>え</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-41668-41677">たれば</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-41677-41707"><rb>人心地</rb><rt>ひとごこち</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-41707-41722">になつて、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-41722-41740"><rb>恰</rb><rt>あたか</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-41740-41743">も</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-41743-41755"><rb>可</rb><rt>よ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-41755-41761">し、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-41761-41785"><rb>谷間</rb><rt>たにあひ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-41785-41812">から、いたはつて、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-41812-41827"><rb>負</rb><rt>おぶ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-41827-41833">つて</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-41833-41845"><rb>世</rb><rt>よ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-41845-41848">に</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-41848-41860"><rb>出</rb><rt>で</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-41860-41866">た。</seg></p>
